# Teva Lowers 2026 Non-GAAP Operating Profit Outlook On Emalex Deal;
...
First quarter net income attributable to Teva were $369 million and $0.31 per share, compared to $214 million and $0.18 per share, a year ago. Non-GAAP net income attributable to Teva was $621 million and $0.53 per share compared to $602 million and $0.52 per share.
